{"word:zakat":{"id":"word:zakat","title":"Almsgiving","source":"word","note":"Zakat is the due alms, from a root meaning purity; sadaqa is a gift of charity. Spending \"in the way of God\" is asked more often than either.","seeAlso":["Prayer","Wealth","The orphan and the poor"],"entries":[{"text":"zakāh (زَكاة): the alms; purity. 32 times in 32 verses.","refs":[[49,49],[89,89],[116,116],[183,183],[283,283],[569,569],[654,654],[680,680],[723,723],[1109,1109],[1239,1239],[1245,1245],[1252,1252],[1305,1305],[2220,2220],[2262,2262],[2280,2280],[2304,2304],[2555,2555],[2635,2635],[2672,2672],[2676,2676],[2827,2827],[2846,2846],[3161,3161],[3447,3447],[3472,3472],[3565,3565],[4224,4224],[5116,5116],[5494,5494],[6134,6134]]},{"text":"ṣadaqa (صَدَقَة): charity. 13 times in 13 verses.","refs":[[202,202],[269,270],[277,277],[282,282],[606,606],[1292,1292],[1294,1294],[1313,1313],[1337,1338],[5115,5116]]},{"text":"anfaqa (أَنفَقَ): to spend. 68 times in 55 verses.","refs":[[9,9],[201,201],[221,221],[225,225],[260,260],[267,268],[270,271],[273,273],[276,276],[278,280],[384,384],[409,409],[426,426],[526,526],[530,531],[732,732],[1162,1162],[1195,1195],[1219,1219],[1222,1222],[1268,1268],[1287,1288],[1325,1326],[1332,1333],[1355,1355],[1728,1728],[1780,1780],[1975,1975],[2181,2181],[2629,2629],[2921,2921],[3305,3305],[3518,3518],[3644,3644],[3688,3688],[3751,3751],[4309,4309],[4582,4582],[5081,5081],[5084,5084],[5159,5160],[5194,5194],[5197,5197],[5214,5214],[5222,5223]]},{"text":"taṣaddaqa (تَصَدَّقَ): to give in charity. 6 times in 6 verses.","refs":[[286,286],[584,584],[713,713],[1309,1309],[1683,1683],[5197,5197]]}]}}